    "meaning": "no, not a, not any",
    "shortDefinition": "The negative of ein: no, not a."
  },
  "intro": {
    "title": "Kein Problem!",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Kein is 'not a' or 'no': Ich habe kein Auto. It negates nouns, while nicht negates verbs and adjectives. It takes exactly the same endings as ein, and unlike ein it has a plural: keine Kinder."
    ]
  },
